sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant L as Lead (research skill, session model)
  participant W as researcher x1-5 (Sonnet, fresh context)
  participant S as synthesizer (session model)
  participant V as verifier (Haiku)
  participant F as research/ files

  U->>L: brief
  L->>F: write runs/slug/PLAN.md (facets, rulings, Outputs pending)
  L->>W: one brief per facet (objective, rulings verbatim, note path, schema)
  W->>F: notes/facet.md (claim, URL or repo file and line, date, tool, quote)
  W-->>L: 10-line summary (takeaways, gaps, confidence, path)
  L->>W: at most one gap-filling round
  L->>S: paths of all notes
  S->>F: findings/slug.md, claim + source + quote copied together
  L->>V: findings path
  V->>F: re-opens at most 20 claims, appends Verification, writes INDEX line
  L->>F: PLAN.md Outputs done, open-questions.md
  L-->>U: result with paths and open questions
